%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: AlftandPt3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141294
    - rid: 4351268349337141295
    - rid: 4351268349337141296
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I think I'm ready to go, you good, Monika?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, let's get moving.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141297
    - rid: 4351268349337141298
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141299
    - rid: 4351268349337141300
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Be careful of that brass pipe above the door.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Why-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141301
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Before Monika can even finish her question, a stream of flame starts
      spraying down in front of the passageway.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796428
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141302
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Fair enough.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141303
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141363
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Do the Falmer live in those weird fleshy tents?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141364
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Before I can answer her question, a Falmer walks out of it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two of us crouch down, not that it would help much considering that
      the Falmer are blind.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141365
    - rid: 4351268349337141366
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Should I take it out from up here?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Pretty sure that one's a he, but yeah. Worst-case scenario we get into
      a fight anyway.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Monika, with more muscle memory under her belt, pulls back an arrow...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796429
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Falmer down.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796430
    - rid: 4351268349337141369
    - rid: 4351268349337141370
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141371
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, is it just me or do my arrows seemingly do more damage if we''re
      sneaking?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141372
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, sneak attacks in game do more damage than when you're detected
      by an enemy-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, probably!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141373
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Wouldn't that make archery and sneaking the best skills, though?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141374
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Because if I can take down an enemy in one hit before they've even noticed
      me...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141375
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Wouldn't that make it so I'd never get hurt in a fight?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141376
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You know, since every single fight ends in one hit.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141377
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: To answer your question, Monika...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes, that's exactly what that means.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141378
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There's a reason the "stealth archer" is a universal experience among
      Skyrim players.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I see...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141380
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, so does that mean I'm the best? Since I'm the only one out of the
      five of us who can be considered a "stealth archer."
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141379
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>What</i>???
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141381
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika, there's no way in hell you're trying to be competitive about
      build choice, when you didn't even know that was a thing!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141382
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: C'mon, <i>you</i> said that stealth archer was a universal experience...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I mean sure, gameplay mechanics seem to be translating to this world...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But I'm sure if she really wanted to, Yuri could come up with some extreme
      magical nonsense that could blow stealth archer out of the water.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>And</i> that's not counting the world-altering nonsense I get access
      to through the Thu'um.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So I'm definitely better than Sayori and Natsuki?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141383
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: What even is this conversation?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141384
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141385
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I was just kidding, {mc}, you don't have to be so uptight about it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141386
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Ah yes, Schroedinger''s Douchebag: if the other person is on board,
      you''re serious, if the other person is not, you''re just joking.'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141387
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: But I really was joking the whole time...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141388
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And it wasn't funny. Don't "joke" like that, Monika.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sorry, {mc}.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141389
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141391
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Hopefully Sayori and Yuri have a better dynamic than {mc} and me.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141393
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
